# devices: iphone-11-usb
# Physical iPhone 11 only (scripts/device-runner): the simulator lanes skip it as not applicable.
# RESCUE-VERIFY live wedge run on the USB iPhone 11, paired to a scratch host
# (scripts/pair-device --route home). After the first capture the host's daemon
# is stopped with SIGSTOP; the supervisor's watchdog replaces it. The phone may
# say "Cupola isn't responding." meanwhile, but it must come back without a tap
# (`wait --never` only passes time; the captures show the phone before, during
# and after).
launch
wait --id open-sidebar --timeout 60
sidebar open
wait --id chats-sidebar --timeout 20
shot rv-wedge-connected
wait --id sidebar-rescue-restart --never 20
shot rv-wedge-during
wait --id sidebar-rescue-restart --never 50
wait --id sidebar-rescue --gone --timeout 5
shot rv-wedge-recovered
